 R←Test_Dir2_001(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;list
⍝ Test the `Dir2` method in the most simple way: just a directory name.
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

 list←##.FilesAndDirs.Dir2 ∆Home
 →T.PassesIf 1=≢list
 →T.PassesIf (≢∆Home)=≢¨list

 list←('type'(2 3 4))##.FilesAndDirs.Dir2 ∆Home
 →T.PassesIf 3=≢list
 →T.PassesIf ¯2=≡list

 R←T._OK
